        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) If the agreement is made within the first half of the tour, the released employee will receive a maximum of four (4) hours pay which includes any productive time at the basic wage rate (5 hours if employee working 4/10s).",
            "block_bbox": [
